# Python lab style

- Prefer type hints on public functions.
- Use `pytest` (not `unittest`).
- Never commit `.env`, API keys, or Gradescope credentials.
- Keep functions small; put demos/examples under `examples/` if needed.
- When fixing bugs, add a regression test that would have failed before the fix.
